/**
 * Legacy `/lotteries` index.
 *
 * Astro redirects from the frontmatter via `Astro.redirect`, which returns a
 * `Response` — the exact equivalent of Next's `redirect()`. 308 is used rather
 * than 302 because this route did not return to the client on later navigation.
 */
return Astro.redirect('/results', 308);
